            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.70

- Fixed the artwork flicker when changing track by swiping in full screen. The new cover arrived, briefly reverted to the previous one, then jumped to the new one again. The swipe was finishing on a fixed timer rather than waiting for the player, which takes up to a second to report a skip, so for a moment the view fell back to showing the cover it still had. It now holds the new cover until the player has genuinely caught up, and the handover is invisible.
- Removed the tap when changing track by swiping. It was too faint to feel, so it was not earning its place.
]]></description>
